      ":question/worked-solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n(-3)a - ((-2)b + (-5)c) &= (-3)\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}-((-2)\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}+(-5)\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ -15\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -35\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ -15\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -49\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-23 \\\\ 34\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
